# Where the recovery-code sync server lives.
#
# Leave this unset in production. The API is served from the same domain as the
# app (the reverse proxy sends /api/* to it), so the app uses the address it was
# loaded from and keeps working if you change domain.
#
# Set it only to point at a different server. It is read at build time, so set it
# before `npm run build`. While developing (`npm run dev`) the app falls back to
# http://localhost:8787 on its own.
# VITE_SYNC_SERVER=https://sync.example
